{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "3a5a414a8325fef5ffa3828600612ebb2565409ee8707377f3fed9cfd0126992", "ja": "バトンタッチ", "zh": "接力棒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b47c834bbde3f1d80003f55c03eaf40b5c77bc9be5f76dcbf63a1c451eb5584e", "ja": "生番組出演を終えひと息ついたのもつかの間\n5人に新たな仕事が舞い込む。依頼を喜び\nつつ、この先を繋いでくれる劇場のみんなの\nためにTeam5thは全力投球を誓う。\nそしてはバトンはTeam6thへ……！", "zh": "刚结束直播节目出演，才稍稍喘了口气，转眼间又有新的工作找上了5人。大家为这份委托感到高兴的同时，也为了今后将梦想延续下去的剧场伙伴们，Team5th发誓要全力以赴。接下来，接力棒将传给Team6th……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "48f85e3d3dab5ca76f408ff108d590c01ab452f85e190053f9822780c2694536", "ja": "番組放送の数日後……", "zh": "节目播出数日后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "8cf0d7d42aa24ec8c24d3152f3777e586d54ed752f157d738046e687b4bce504", "ja": "おはようございます！　……ふふ、やっぱり。\nみんな、もう揃ってると思ってたんだ♪", "zh": "早上好！……呵呵，果然。\n我就猜大家已经到齐了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "55a76f3aef005e5784790ba5111828a04d8b400554d249adf73c5eec1e4844e1", "ja": "おはようございます、紗代子さん。\nわたし、なんだか早起きになっちゃったみたいです。", "zh": "早上好，纱代子姐姐。\n我好像不知不觉变得早起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "eff18541816463e730f0b0675dbb2d9b7f4e1b8841a09d1c736230d059bc3651", "ja": "わたしも！\n朝早く起きると、気持ちいいもんね♪", "zh": "我也是！\n早上早起真的很舒服呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "189da6410db62a44b422d0b848022293b2c16b5136c3bbc37c0f8bdfd84b6d31", "ja": "それに、今朝はお散歩日和でしたからね～。\n劇場に来るまでの道で、ばっちり目も覚めました～。", "zh": "而且，今天早上正是适合散步的好天气呢～。走来剧场的路上，我也彻底清醒了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "681e58336d64f279bb9783a7a0a42e3799434cb295f77caa5f9435f089bb653c", "ja": "うっ、なんて爽やかな会話……！\n徹夜作業明けの茜ちゃんにはまぶしすぎる……！", "zh": "呜，这对话也太清爽了……！\n对刚熬夜工作结束的小茜来说，实在太耀眼了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1006_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "974e8ddcd4a6873977b9a74059fed77c2b124b1811834942ab3035e3f06d27eb", "ja": "徹夜明けって……茜、また何か発注しようとか、\nしてないよな？", "zh": "通宵之后……茜，你该不会又打算\n订购什么东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "fc18898aedeaecf663d4773aed54563fc2b266dcbd2a6d52ab27b2e9428adb58", "ja": "はっ、プロちゃん！？　もう、茜ちゃんの夜更かしが\nそんなに気になるのかニャ？", "zh": "啊，制作人！？真是的，你就这么在意小茜熬夜的事吗，喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "7708924dba51ad679d082cc4afd72181e1fa3ba9415bb4dda7b5bebf15ce0f1a", "ja": "気になるっ。確かにスプーンは好評だったけど……\nだからって、次はカトラリーセットとはいかないぞ？", "zh": "我当然会在意。勺子确实很受欢迎……但也不能因为这样，下一次就送餐具套装吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "47a2005fe5f0053b93b601510a07c7cbd3dcc957a76d6674157ad25697bf6e71", "ja": "ギクッ！？　や、やだなぁ、さすがにそんな予定は、\nないこともないこともないこともゴニョゴニョだよ？", "zh": "惊！？　没、没什么啦，怎么会呢，当然不至于有那种打算……也不能说没有，也不能说不是没有，也不能说……嘟嘟囔囔的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "5917c49561c772054702ddc6c396b298c9e95b6095e0ba8b7b069d2ca6236e41", "ja": "何だって？　……とにかく、夜はちゃんと寝ること！\n次の仕事にも万全で取り組んでもらいたいからな。", "zh": "你说什么？……总之，晚上要好好睡觉！\n因为我希望你也能以最佳状态投入下一份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "6e0a306efc14bf7d4ec3d1bc0c4dd47fe960c6bad2a533ac1fa10d875285afb7", "ja": "次のお仕事？　……あの、プロデューサーさん。\nもしかして、わたし達みんなのですか？", "zh": "下一个工作？……那个，制作人先生。\n难道是我们大家的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "bd4c6d0d0cd2d58fd82f782391a727c3d69e4d00511d1dcc3e8b4b459d0be7f0", "ja": "そういうこと！　今日もすでに全員集まってるし、\nミーティングを始めようか。", "zh": "就是这样！今天大家也已经到齐了，\n那就开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "faf81aec159f6a405fd908c7c35bdb446cfe6f60941f792dfeb9dea2b29df7c4", "ja": "実は昨日、この前の放送局から連絡があったんだ。\n『地元からオハヨー！』特別出演の好評を受けて……", "zh": "其实昨天，上次那家电视台联系了我。\n说是由于在《来自当地的早安！》里的特别演出大获好评……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "05084e0c92571bd088b7e9428fd0dc00c91d7d9a0e548e180ab8089da8a33a16", "ja": "それぞれに、CMや番組出演のオファーが届いた！\nみんなの頑張りが報われたんだ！", "zh": "大家都收到了广告和节目出演的邀约！\n大家的努力终于有了回报！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
