{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "7913a273914a69f455c1787b81c3e76d31bb6cff86b9f54629f9af151dec1b59", "ja": "おお～♪", "zh": "喔喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "d1b50ee4a29659c3baacdda934101b0a6c90c014981d73dfaddcda2bca3314f9", "ja": "お仕事に向き合って、しっかり頑張ったことが……\n本当に、次に繋がったんだ……！", "zh": "认真面对工作、努力坚持的付出……\n真的和下一次机会联系起来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "00c7e51e0fadf07b6f488ce243c7ca98d815127248d4800885bac5a5187d70b4", "ja": "ってことは、プリン！\n茜ちゃんは今度こそプリンを食べられるんだよね！？", "zh": "也就是说，是布丁！  \n小茜这次终于能吃到布丁了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "2a3d8680d7bd1bfc3454b5890cd4a291c774a2ac396cc5d4fb17f85d427c686c", "ja": "あっ、わたしのお仕事は、ドッグランのCMです。\n……えっ？　これって、ジュニオールと一緒に！？", "zh": "啊，我的工作是拍狗狗乐园的广告。\n……咦？也就是说，要和朱尼奥尔一起！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb760f4bf20a13e21cfede986644b1c968938a07142d6ca1bf524d8526dd4eb5", "ja": "わたしは、子ども番組のゲストおねえさんだって！\nうんと大人っぽく、がんばろうっと！", "zh": "我是去儿童节目当特邀大姐姐哦！\n我一定要表现得成熟一点，好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "80641d7f4a99d2d3d543ad4be8916b2c1c58cee51ac06d84d6dd9d5dc3a37d96", "ja": "私はお土産のナレーションですか～。\n今度は練習で、お土産を買いに行かなくては～。", "zh": "我是负责伴手礼的旁白吗～。下次为了练习，得去买伴手礼才行～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "279cfe0ef2d7763256ea4cc22cc173ef20ce4b1179120e1210203d2803ac8fc6", "ja": "私は、たい焼きの食レポ！？　すごい……。\nずっとやってみたかったの！", "zh": "我要做鲷鱼烧的美食点评！？好厉害……我一直都想试试呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "fb6334d8db8ba356b37a31575b81c758f9beeb3f1ee93c41ed19a4be8b60ae9b", "ja": "よかったですね～。\nこれは改めて、気合いを入れないといけませんな～。", "zh": "太好了呢～。\n这次得重新鼓足干劲才行了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "757fbab8c15fbea93cb9c7547356953b476c77f40261028e111bb2d067143276", "ja": "うん。Team1stから始まって、2nd、3rd、4th。\nみんながここまで繋いでくれたんだもん。", "zh": "嗯。从Team1st开始，2nd、3rd、4th。都是大家一路接力到现在的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "3f33965f3bea37ccb3da47f18b16e5c8cd3104b387dcbc04aa0060d3a2c6f861", "ja": "私達は、これから繋いでくれるみんなのために！\n……ですよね、プロデューサー！", "zh": "为了今后接过这份接力棒的大家！……对吧，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "6d1d7bc0184d7953b0a0714e4d306ca7f781365c29faadaee47e20ccebfe7332", "ja": "……うん、その通りだ。\n今回の仕事の結果も、絶対次のチームに繋がっていく。", "zh": "……嗯，你说得对。\n这次工作带来的成果，也一定会传递给下一支队伍的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_06_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "e48a08601f2a6df755276be871c57e9718856f42c347aaf473b30cd7ad07eb23", "ja": "だから、今は自分の仕事に全力投球してくれ。\n明日からの、劇場のみんなのために！", "zh": "所以，现在就全力以赴完成自己的工作吧。\n为了从明天开始的剧场大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
